1
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,400
Greetings, Commander.

2
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,530
You've been working hard, Commander.

3
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:32,560
Rest assured, Commander.

4
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,110
Everything is normal in Qianshan.

5
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,070
Under your wise and capable governance,

6
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:38,310
not a single opium pipe
can be found in Qianshan now.

7
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:39,280
We will show no mercy

8
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,500
to anyone caught hiding one.

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,540
The people all sing your praises.

10
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,430
You're getting better and better
at talking.

11
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,190
I'm only back here catching my breath

12
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,960
because over 1,000 of my men
gave their lives for it.

13
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,240
The ceasefire is only temporary.

14
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:56,880
Your Guard Corps will inevitably
be sent to the front lines as well.

15
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,740
You'd better prepare in advance.

16
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,290
Yes, Commander.

17
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:03,750
Reporting, Commander.

18
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:04,550
She's here.

19
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:19,370
Do you find her pretty?

20
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:21,030
I wouldn't dare, Commander.

21
00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:21,800
You may leave.

22
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,390
Then I'll take my leave.

23
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,640
It's been a long time,

24
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:29,800
Miss Jiang.

25
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:14,200
[A Prophet]

26
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,930
[Episode 5]

27
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,800
Corpse Driving?

28
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,590
It's a form of sorcery
practiced in Xiangxi.

29
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:22,960
Back when there were wars,

30
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,960
many people from Xiangxi
died far from home.

31
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,360
Some local sorcerers

32
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:27,710
would then use soul-summoning rituals

33
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:29,240
to gather
their three souls and seven spirits

34
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,480
back into the corpses.

35
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,240
That way, they could bring the bodies home

36
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,520
so the dead wouldn't
become wandering ghosts.

37
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,320
We actually do this kind of work?

38
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,550
Well, there you go.

39
00:03:37,550 --> 00:03:38,320
I'm telling you,

40
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,390
our Longxuya Corpse Driving

41
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,050
is really famous around here.

42
00:03:41,829 --> 00:03:43,030
They call it sorcery,

43
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,110
but in reality,
it's all done by living people.

44
00:03:45,110 --> 00:03:46,640
Exactly. It's all done by living people.

45
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,430
They wash the corpses clean.

46
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,550
Then they take a knife

47
00:03:49,550 --> 00:03:50,200
to cut them open,

48
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,240
remove all the internal organs,

49
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,240
and fill the body cavities
with a preservative solution

50
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:52,920
to keep them from rotting.

51
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,760
Once the bodies have dried,

52
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,590
they tie them to poles

53
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:55,200
and string them together.

54
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,110
Then two strong men

55
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:57,550
can carry them all the way home.

56
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:58,760
After all that,

57
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:02,240
would anyone still believe in the whole
three souls and seven spirits story?

58
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:04,080
That's where our cleverness comes in.

59
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,640
Let me tell you,

60
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,830
these corpse drivers

61
00:04:05,830 --> 00:04:07,760
dress the corpses in burial robes.

62
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:08,990
Then those two strong men

63
00:04:08,990 --> 00:04:10,250
dress up as corpses too

64
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,410
and make the corpses "jump" along.

65
00:04:13,550 --> 00:04:14,550
If anyone happens

66
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:16,269
to stop and watch along the way,

67
00:04:16,269 --> 00:04:18,029
they pull little tricks
like making the corpses rise

68
00:04:18,029 --> 00:04:20,180
or pretending there are ghosts,
just to scare them away.

69
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:23,110
They'd go home and spread the story
from door to door.

70
00:04:24,030 --> 00:04:27,680
No wonder Xiangxi Corpse Driving
has been passed down for a thousand years.

71
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,470
Anyway, back to the matter at hand.

72
00:04:29,470 --> 00:04:31,230
Mr. Zheng's coal mine in Anping

73
00:04:31,230 --> 00:04:32,909
had a mining accident recently,

74
00:04:32,909 --> 00:04:34,909
and his son was buried underground.

75
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,470
He hired us

76
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:38,370
to bring the body back for burial.

77
00:04:38,409 --> 00:04:40,740
Heng is already waiting
for you in Anping.

78
00:04:41,150 --> 00:04:42,100
Who is Heng?

79
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,330
The Chief's nephew.

80
00:04:44,390 --> 00:04:46,030
Zheng Tianming is hosting a banquet

81
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:47,890
at Sanyuan Restaurant tomorrow.

82
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:49,110
Ruhui,

83
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:50,950
Starting tomorrow,

84
00:04:51,710 --> 00:04:53,760
you'll be the 18th-generation successor

85
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,350
to Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

86
00:04:55,790 --> 00:04:56,520
Me?

87
00:05:02,710 --> 00:05:05,080
Sir, spare me a bite to eat.

88
00:05:05,350 --> 00:05:06,880
Please, I'm begging you.

89
00:05:14,030 --> 00:05:15,270
Thank you, sir.

90
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:23,880
[No. 26, Jiudao Kan. Come see me at once.]

91
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:33,520
Have you looked into Zheng Tianming?

92
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,640
He does exist.

93
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,710
And there really is a mine in Anping.

94
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:42,540
Why would Blind Du specifically
send you for this Corpse Driving task?

95
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:44,770
Blind Du probably
has other dealings with Zheng Tianming,

96
00:05:44,770 --> 00:05:46,830
so he considers him quite important.

97
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:49,010
It makes sense for me to go

98
00:05:49,030 --> 00:05:50,830
as a successor of Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

99
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:51,590
Besides,

100
00:05:51,830 --> 00:05:53,159
if anything goes wrong,

101
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:55,030
they can pin the blame on me

102
00:05:55,230 --> 00:05:57,159
instead of implicating Longxuya.

103
00:05:58,909 --> 00:06:01,080
Corpse Driving
isn't some elaborate scheme.

104
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,640
It's just transporting bodies back

105
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,270
and making a few bucks for the work.

106
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:05,440
What could go wrong?

107
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:09,320
If this really is just Corpse Driving,

108
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,380
Longxuya has plenty of low-level men

109
00:06:11,910 --> 00:06:13,370
Mr. Zheng has seen before.

110
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:23,640
You got through the Pangzhou affair
far too smoothly.

111
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,590
I know

112
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:27,080
you look down on the Tianxiang Sect

113
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:28,710
and on Blind Du.

114
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:30,470
But I'm warning you,

115
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,760
they're all wolves in human form.

116
00:06:34,230 --> 00:06:35,830
If you underestimate them,

117
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:39,320
they'll swallow you whole,
flesh and skin,

118
00:06:40,150 --> 00:06:42,480
without leaving so much
as a scrap of bone.

119
00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:44,590
Whatever comes, we'll handle it.

120
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,710
If there really
is something fishy going on,

121
00:06:47,710 --> 00:06:48,570
I'm not afraid.

122
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:54,390
All right.

123
00:06:56,230 --> 00:06:57,790
Since you've already agreed,

124
00:06:57,790 --> 00:06:58,680
then go ahead.

125
00:06:59,710 --> 00:07:01,370
Just be careful along the way.

126
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:03,100
Yes.

127
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,610
Have you been to Blind Du's hideout

128
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,470
before?

129
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:14,320
But it's heavily guarded
and not easy to infiltrate.

130
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:15,150
That's one of the reasons

131
00:07:15,150 --> 00:07:17,320
I agreed to this Corpse Driving task.

132
00:07:18,230 --> 00:07:19,000
Besides,

133
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:24,370
I've noticed something suspicious.

134
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,560
So you're the expert from Xiangxi.

135
00:08:04,770 --> 00:08:06,030
What should I call you?

136
00:08:06,030 --> 00:08:07,030
My surname is Lyu.

137
00:08:08,710 --> 00:08:09,590
Mr. Lyu,

138
00:08:10,030 --> 00:08:11,160
please, have a seat.

139
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,010
I deal with the dead,

140
00:08:14,150 --> 00:08:15,710
so I carry a strong corpse aura.

141
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:17,570
I shouldn't be around the living.

142
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,350
Mr. Lyu,

143
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,540
I've asked you here

144
00:08:20,590 --> 00:08:21,790
to help

145
00:08:21,790 --> 00:08:24,390
bring my son's body back from Anping.

146
00:08:25,030 --> 00:08:27,790
I have only one son, my sole heir.

147
00:08:27,890 --> 00:08:29,890
Now that we're separated
by life and death,

148
00:08:29,890 --> 00:08:31,280
this is all

149
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:33,990
I can do for him.

150
00:08:34,990 --> 00:08:35,850
Bring the lamp.

151
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:40,870
What...

152
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:42,960
What does this mean?

153
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,280
Mr. Zheng,

154
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,300
please clear your mind for now

155
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:48,780
and recall your son's face and voice.

156
00:09:08,070 --> 00:09:09,630
W-W-What's going on?

157
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,590
The lamp lit itself without any fire.

158
00:09:11,590 --> 00:09:13,100
This lamp is called a Soul-Guiding Lamp.

159
00:09:13,100 --> 00:09:15,810
It is meant
to guide your son's spirit home.

160
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,790
You'll also need to place this lamp

161
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,520
in the family mourning hall.

162
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:20,860
After seven days,

163
00:09:21,230 --> 00:09:22,760
when we return with the body

164
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,710
and his wandering soul
returns to the body,

165
00:09:24,710 --> 00:09:25,840
the lamp will go out.

166
00:09:26,630 --> 00:09:27,590
In that case,

167
00:09:28,110 --> 00:09:29,240
I'll leave it to you,

168
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:30,920
Mr. Lyu.

169
00:09:37,170 --> 00:09:41,420
[Anping]

170
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,400
Let's go.

171
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:56,800
Senior Du.

172
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,010
You're here.

173
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,640
Come on in.

174
00:10:00,830 --> 00:10:01,360
Let's go.

175
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:03,990
Come on,

176
00:10:03,990 --> 00:10:04,450
inside.

177
00:10:09,350 --> 00:10:10,950
This is Zheng Qigong's body.

178
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,830
The others are the bodies
of his fellow townsmen.

179
00:10:12,830 --> 00:10:14,040
We'll take them all back together.

180
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,750
Senior Du,

181
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,870
how many strings of coins
did you hang up,

182
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:19,000
and how many talismans did you put out?

183
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,110
Everything was done
according to the usual practice.

184
00:10:21,110 --> 00:10:21,780
No problem.

185
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,320
I've got everything ready.

186
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:26,990
No need to check.

187
00:10:26,990 --> 00:10:27,900
You must be tired from the journey.

188
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:28,630
Have some water.

189
00:10:28,630 --> 00:10:29,040
Come,

190
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:29,880
sit down.

191
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:33,200
I've got everything you need
ready for you.

192
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,200
Let's hurry and get you dressed up.

193
00:10:35,230 --> 00:10:36,230
Once it gets dark,

194
00:10:36,230 --> 00:10:38,030
we'll get on the road right away.

195
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:39,110
All right.

196
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:40,490
What's this for?

197
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:43,160
Who's supposed to wear this?

198
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,400
When the dead pass through,

199
00:10:52,990 --> 00:10:55,230
the living must keep their distance.

200
00:10:55,730 --> 00:10:57,730
Copper bells lead the way.

201
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,750
The road to the underworld opens.

202
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,280
We escort the dead home,

203
00:11:03,990 --> 00:11:05,850
so they may return to their roots.

204
00:11:06,830 --> 00:11:09,230
The dead carry yin energy
and evil spirits;

205
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:11,340
the living must keep their distance.

206
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,590
When the dead pass through,

207
00:11:15,350 --> 00:11:17,470
the living must keep their distance.

208
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,440
Copper bells lead the way.

209
00:11:21,110 --> 00:11:23,350
The road to the underworld opens.

210
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,800
Halt.

211
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,450
It'll be light soon.

212
00:11:27,830 --> 00:11:28,760
We'll camp here.

213
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:30,470
Senior Du,

214
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:32,430
how are we supposed to sleep out here?

215
00:11:32,430 --> 00:11:33,830
There's a river up ahead.

216
00:11:33,830 --> 00:11:35,160
We'll camp by the river.

217
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,370
The woods by the river

218
00:11:36,370 --> 00:11:37,770
are lush and full of life.

219
00:11:38,110 --> 00:11:39,510
Resting the corpses against the trees

220
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:43,040
will keep their three souls
and seven spirits from dispersing.

221
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,070
Senior Du,

222
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:46,870
I know Corpse Driving is supposed
to be done by night and rest by day.

223
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:49,160
But shouldn't we rest
when we get to the mortuary?

224
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,390
If these bodies get mauled
by wild animals in the mountains,

225
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:52,920
we'll have a hard time explaining it
when we get back.

226
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,520
Why do you have so much to say?

227
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:56,200
We'll rest where I say we rest.

228
00:11:56,570 --> 00:11:57,860
How about we switch? You carry them.

229
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:58,410
No, no.

230
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,200
Why aren't we resting at the mortuary?

231
00:12:04,510 --> 00:12:07,400
This is such a miserable place
to spend the night.

232
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,350
You'll have to ask Senior Du.

233
00:12:10,990 --> 00:12:13,100
He's the one who said we should camp here.

234
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:14,430
He's Chief Du's nephew.

235
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,560
We do as he says.

236
00:12:17,230 --> 00:12:19,800
If one of the corpses really does rise,
it'll be on him.

237
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:20,990
Don't scare me.

238
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,510
One of the corpses has turned!

239
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,200
What?

240
00:12:33,870 --> 00:12:34,800
What's going on?

241
00:12:35,590 --> 00:12:36,720
A corpse has turned!

242
00:12:37,660 --> 00:12:39,510
When a corpse turns on the way home,

243
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:41,320
it's either because the dead
bore a grievance in life

244
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,320
or met with misfortune after death.

245
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:44,560
You,

246
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:45,960
go see what's going on.

247
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,680
Me?

248
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:47,420
Go!

249
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:54,080
Be careful.

250
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:48,080
Oh my, it scared the life out of me.

251
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:49,920
Oh my!

252
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:51,230
Oh my!

253
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:53,970
You damn monkey!

254
00:13:54,510 --> 00:13:57,040
They're already dead, and now they
have to be mauled by monkeys.

255
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:57,640
Senior Du,

256
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,160
I told you we should've stayed
at the mortuary.

257
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:01,040
That damn monkey

258
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:02,440
scared the hell out of me.

259
00:14:03,110 --> 00:14:04,470
Are the bodies all right?

260
00:14:04,470 --> 00:14:05,320
They're fine, they're fine.

261
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:05,990
I checked them.

262
00:14:05,990 --> 00:14:06,920
They are intact.

263
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:08,530
Silly Liang,

264
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:09,320
give me a hand.

265
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,350
It's almost daylight.

266
00:14:10,350 --> 00:14:12,210
Let's cover them with this cloth.

267
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,510
One, two, lift.

268
00:14:23,830 --> 00:14:25,200
Greetings, Chief.

269
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,760
Sorry to keep you waiting,
Adjutant Xu.

270
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:30,160
Chief Du,

271
00:14:30,370 --> 00:14:33,030
it's only a few steps
to the Longxuya inner hall.

272
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:35,440
Do you really need
to lean on a human crutch?

273
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,370
I've been waiting here for an hour.

274
00:14:37,470 --> 00:14:39,000
What are you going on about?

275
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:41,110
I normally wouldn't, of course.

276
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:43,240
But you came first thing this morning.

277
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:44,890
You must have something important
to discuss.

278
00:14:44,890 --> 00:14:46,220
I had to hurry, didn't I?

279
00:14:47,990 --> 00:14:49,120
All of you, get lost.

280
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:51,900
You too, get lost.

281
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,130
Adjutant Xu,

282
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,610
Hey, hey. Let me remind you:

283
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:01,830
I'm not in uniform today.

284
00:15:01,830 --> 00:15:03,290
Don't call me Adjutant Xu.

285
00:15:03,710 --> 00:15:05,310
Call me Mr. Zheng, all right?

286
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:06,940
Okay, okay, Mr. Zheng.

287
00:15:06,950 --> 00:15:08,480
What brings you here today?

288
00:15:11,590 --> 00:15:14,520
Don't you think we need
to get moving on our business?

289
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:16,090
We discussed this before.

290
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:18,160
If we're going to do this deal,

291
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:20,800
we have to wait for things to die down.

292
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:24,200
If your Colonel Lei hadn't
been embezzling military pay

293
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:26,370
to the point where he can't cover
the shortfall anymore,

294
00:15:26,370 --> 00:15:28,400
we Longxuya wouldn't have had

295
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:30,160
to risk our lives

296
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:32,650
to take this deal.

297
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,150
You...

298
00:15:40,990 --> 00:15:42,190
All right, all right.

299
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:43,350
Mr. Du,

300
00:15:43,350 --> 00:15:44,800
you're right.

301
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,400
From here on out,

302
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,000
I'll do as you say, all right?

303
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:50,200
But...

304
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:52,800
But Commander Feng
has given strict orders:

305
00:15:53,230 --> 00:15:55,830
anyone caught selling opium
will be executed.

306
00:15:57,230 --> 00:15:59,160
Then what am I supposed
to tell the Colonel?

307
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,690
Go back and tell Colonel Lei

308
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:03,470
I have another gift prepared for him.

309
00:16:03,470 --> 00:16:05,600
Not only will it make up for his losses,

310
00:16:05,710 --> 00:16:07,770
it'll even get him promoted one rank.

311
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,110
How so?

312
00:16:10,830 --> 00:16:12,290
I have a trick up my sleeve.

313
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:13,960
Ruhui,

314
00:16:14,110 --> 00:16:14,970
let me tell you,

315
00:16:15,350 --> 00:16:17,040
spearfishing takes skill.

316
00:16:17,230 --> 00:16:18,230
You can't just stab straight down,

317
00:16:18,230 --> 00:16:18,750
you know?

318
00:16:18,750 --> 00:16:20,410
You have to aim a little lower.

319
00:16:29,470 --> 00:16:30,000
See that?

320
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:31,170
How's my skill?

321
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,600
Pretty good.

322
00:16:34,190 --> 00:16:35,510
It'd be a shame
not to make a fisherman out of you.

323
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:36,040
Right?

324
00:16:36,830 --> 00:16:37,590
Liang.

325
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,900
Why did you join Longxuya
in the first place?

326
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,560
Just to make a living.

327
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:45,360
What's this?

328
00:16:48,990 --> 00:16:49,990
It's opium paste.

329
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,060
What, you're into this stuff?

330
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:52,920
What,

331
00:16:53,650 --> 00:16:54,250
want some?

332
00:16:54,590 --> 00:16:55,990
I don't touch this stuff.

333
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,960
And I'd advise you not to either.

334
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:58,400
I'm telling you,

335
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:00,470
the new Commander Feng in Qianshan
hates this stuff more than anything.

336
00:17:00,470 --> 00:17:03,330
If you get caught with it,
you'll be shot on the spot.

337
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,230
Then tell me,

338
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:06,640
if our branch

339
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,700
gets caught selling opium paste,

340
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,450
what do you think will happen?

341
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,609
What do you mean?

342
00:17:13,710 --> 00:17:15,010
This block of opium paste

343
00:17:15,010 --> 00:17:16,540
came out of a corpse.

344
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:17,920
A corpse?

345
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,310
You mean...

346
00:17:24,690 --> 00:17:26,410
you mean Senior Du?

347
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,310
Now, is it

348
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:29,310
worth losing your life

349
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:29,960
just to make a living?

350
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:30,920
Of course not.

351
00:17:31,810 --> 00:17:33,310
Maybe we should report it
to the authorities.

352
00:17:33,310 --> 00:17:34,110
You fool.

353
00:17:34,130 --> 00:17:35,360
The opium paste is inside the corpse,

354
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:36,600
and we're both corpse drivers.

355
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:37,510
If we report it,

356
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:39,840
how could either of us prove
we have nothing to do with it?

357
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:40,840
Then what do we do?

358
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:43,170
We're done for.

359
00:17:44,550 --> 00:17:45,360
Liang,

360
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:47,360
you said earlier

361
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:48,550
that our branch has handled plenty

362
00:17:48,550 --> 00:17:50,080
of corpse-transport jobs.

363
00:17:50,270 --> 00:17:52,030
You really don't know

364
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,570
what we've been transporting?

365
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:55,990
Heaven and earth, gods and spirits above,

366
00:17:55,990 --> 00:17:56,920
I, Silly Liang,
swear I have absolutely no idea.

367
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:57,750
Even if I did know,

368
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,840
I wouldn't dare get involved with them.

369
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:00,680
We're done for, we're done for.

370
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,510
If this gets discovered,

371
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:02,970
we'll definitely be shot.

372
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,070
I haven't even

373
00:18:04,070 --> 00:18:05,200
gotten married yet.

374
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,470
How about we set fire to it,

375
00:18:08,470 --> 00:18:09,000
then run?

376
00:18:09,230 --> 00:18:09,880
No.

377
00:18:10,750 --> 00:18:12,330
We need to get back as soon as possible,

378
00:18:12,330 --> 00:18:14,640
and we need to take
this batch of opium paste with us.

379
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,320
Why?

380
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:18,880
There's nothing you or I
can do on the way.

381
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,120
We can only find a way

382
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,500
out of this dead end

383
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:23,100
once we get back to Qianshan.

384
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:30,660
You just said Commander Feng in Qianshan

385
00:18:30,660 --> 00:18:31,880
hates this stuff the most?

386
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:32,410
Exactly.

387
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:36,510
Senior Du,

388
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:39,550
where are we putting the bodies
once we get back to Qianshan?

389
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:40,950
Yongzhen Taoist Temple.

390
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,920
Once we deliver the bodies there

391
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:44,400
and get them ready,

392
00:18:44,710 --> 00:18:46,550
the families will come
on the fifth day of the lunar month.

393
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:48,200
Once the funeral rites are done
and the bodies are buried,

394
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,200
our job

395
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,840
will be finished.

396
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,530
Three days left.

397
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,600
We've got plenty of time.

398
00:18:58,470 --> 00:18:59,070
Senior Du,

399
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,100
here you go.

400
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:00,910
Is it done?

401
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,160
Senior Du,

402
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:07,440
if you ask me,

403
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:10,070
we should take the main road from here.

404
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:12,000
The sooner we get back, the better.

405
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,600
There's war in the north.

406
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,840
There are checkpoints

407
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:16,440
everywhere on the main road,

408
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:19,360
and the questioning alone
will take us a lot more time.

409
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:20,160
The back roads

410
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,900
would be more manageable.

411
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,710
Who's going to check us?
We're corpse drivers.

412
00:19:24,710 --> 00:19:25,550
Besides, I think

413
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:26,790
it might rain.

414
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,880
The back roads will be muddy then.

415
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:30,840
If anything goes wrong,
we'll be in trouble.

416
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:31,640
Besides,

417
00:19:32,030 --> 00:19:32,430
it's no good making the long,

418
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:34,400
arduous journey back.

419
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:36,200
Let's get into the city sooner.

420
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,260
We can have some fun

421
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,790
while we have the chance.

422
00:19:43,230 --> 00:19:43,830
All right.

423
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:46,030
We'll take the main road

424
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:47,230
as you suggest, then.

425
00:19:51,140 --> 00:19:52,380
I only speared two.

426
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:54,330
How about I take a hit first?

427
00:20:07,190 --> 00:20:08,080
You go first.

428
00:20:08,470 --> 00:20:09,800
I'll go spear some more.

429
00:20:12,910 --> 00:20:13,670
Your papers.

430
00:20:14,650 --> 00:20:15,850
Here you go, officer.

431
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:21,640
Who are you?

432
00:20:22,210 --> 00:20:24,470
What are you doing here, playing tricks?

433
00:20:24,550 --> 00:20:25,160
Officer,

434
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,900
we're corpse drivers,

435
00:20:27,410 --> 00:20:28,640
taking the dead home.

436
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,240
Corpse drivers?

437
00:20:31,340 --> 00:20:32,580
Are you planning

438
00:20:32,990 --> 00:20:34,640
to put on a play dressed like that?

439
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,960
The corpse can move on its own?

440
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,030
How do you do that?

441
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,840
It's sorcery,
passed down through generations.

442
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,770
It's hard to explain in a few words.

443
00:20:43,470 --> 00:20:45,640
Let me see what kind of sorcery it is.

444
00:20:46,490 --> 00:20:47,060
Officer,

445
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:48,710
this is a shroud.

446
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,400
It doesn't have any pockets
to hide anything in.

447
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,360
We won't know

448
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,500
until we search it.

449
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,550
You can't undo the shroud.

450
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,160
Otherwise, the three souls
and seven spirits won't stay together.

451
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,160
Get out of the way!

452
00:20:58,550 --> 00:20:59,710
How am I supposed to know

453
00:20:59,710 --> 00:21:01,510
what's inside if I don't undo it?

454
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,360
I'll undo them all.

455
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:08,340
Screw you!

456
00:21:18,030 --> 00:21:19,230
How dare you raise a hand to me!

457
00:21:19,230 --> 00:21:20,270
You've got a death wish.

458
00:21:20,270 --> 00:21:21,120
Beat him up!

459
00:21:27,030 --> 00:21:28,880
Stop! Stop! Please! Stop!

460
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:30,510
Officer.

461
00:21:31,470 --> 00:21:32,840
How did these two come back to life?

462
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:33,970
Human! We're human!

463
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,440
Human!

464
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:37,200
Living humans!

465
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:37,880
It's a misunderstanding.

466
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:38,510
Please,

467
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,900
have mercy, officers.

468
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,710
Officer,

469
00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:41,840
please calm down.

470
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:42,880
My friend here

471
00:21:43,270 --> 00:21:44,210
has lived deep
in the mountains all his life

472
00:21:44,210 --> 00:21:45,310
and doesn't know any better.

473
00:21:45,310 --> 00:21:46,090
He broke the rules.

474
00:21:46,090 --> 00:21:47,350
Please, go easy on him.

475
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:49,780
Enough with the excuses!

476
00:21:49,780 --> 00:21:50,310
Officer.

477
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:51,970
I'll put you somewhere else

478
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:53,960
so you can cool off.

479
00:21:54,470 --> 00:21:55,270
Take him away!

480
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:55,840
Officer!

481
00:21:55,990 --> 00:21:56,600
Get lost!

482
00:21:56,650 --> 00:21:57,180
No, wait.

483
00:21:57,820 --> 00:21:59,630
Officer, please don't take him away!

484
00:21:59,630 --> 00:22:00,600
Please don't!

485
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:02,840
Officer!

486
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:03,870
How dare he

487
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,350
lay a hand on the officers?

488
00:22:05,350 --> 00:22:06,480
He acted too rashly.

489
00:22:06,830 --> 00:22:08,090
What are we going to do?

490
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:08,990
How

491
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,260
should I know?

492
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:13,000
We'll figure it out when we get back.

493
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:27,960
It's really heavy.

494
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:37,030
Let me do it.

495
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,040
Senior Du,

496
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:42,500
we can't just leave Ruhui behind.

497
00:22:43,470 --> 00:22:44,310
How are we supposed to help?

498
00:22:44,310 --> 00:22:46,270
He brought it on himself by showing off.

499
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:47,130
He deserves it!

500
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,790
Calm down, calm down.

501
00:22:49,120 --> 00:22:50,780
Senior Du, you're so capable.

502
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:52,390
Please, think of something.

503
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:56,820
What rotten luck.

504
00:23:02,550 --> 00:23:03,950
Stay here and keep watch.

505
00:23:04,470 --> 00:23:05,440
It's our last night.

506
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:07,040
Don't let anything go wrong.

507
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:07,880
Okay.

508
00:23:13,120 --> 00:23:14,470
There has to be a way.

509
00:23:14,550 --> 00:23:17,120
It'll work.

510
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:23,800
Adjutant Xu.

511
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:28,580
What are you doing here?

512
00:23:28,580 --> 00:23:29,580
You scared me.

513
00:23:30,120 --> 00:23:30,920
Where are the goods?

514
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:32,600
The goods are already at
Yongzhen Taoist Temple outside the city.

515
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:33,400
They'll reach

516
00:23:33,600 --> 00:23:34,550
Longxuya first thing tomorrow morning.

517
00:23:34,550 --> 00:23:37,710
Then why aren't you keeping an eye
on the goods? What are you doing here?

518
00:23:37,710 --> 00:23:38,440
Adjutant Xu,

519
00:23:39,510 --> 00:23:41,400
one of my men got into a scuffle

520
00:23:41,630 --> 00:23:43,440
with the military police
while passing through the city gate.

521
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,640
He's been detained.

522
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:45,690
Do you think you could—

523
00:23:45,690 --> 00:23:47,160
Nothing was exposed, right?

524
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:47,920
Don't worry.

525
00:23:48,500 --> 00:23:49,430
Absolutely not.

526
00:23:51,020 --> 00:23:52,480
It's just one low-level man, isn't it?

527
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,440
So what if they arrested him?

528
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,310
At most, he'll get a beating

529
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:55,880
and be released in a few days.

530
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:57,070
That's true, but,

531
00:23:57,470 --> 00:23:58,200
Adjutant Xu,

532
00:23:58,350 --> 00:23:59,480
this man is involved

533
00:23:59,570 --> 00:24:01,290
in the gift for Colonel Lei.

534
00:24:02,030 --> 00:24:02,990
What do you mean?

535
00:24:03,470 --> 00:24:04,000
I mean...

536
00:24:07,230 --> 00:24:10,160
You really are good at messing things up.

537
00:24:11,710 --> 00:24:12,400
Wait here.

538
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,330
I'll make a call.

539
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,210
Thank you, Adjutant Xu.

540
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,840
May Ruhui be safe

541
00:24:19,980 --> 00:24:21,440
and return here unharmed.

542
00:24:28,230 --> 00:24:29,760
How did you end up so beat up?

543
00:24:30,130 --> 00:24:31,130
Come on, let's go.

544
00:24:34,630 --> 00:24:35,630
Are you all right?

545
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:37,120
Those bastards...

546
00:24:37,190 --> 00:24:38,360
If they hadn't had guns,

547
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:38,680
I would've—

548
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,310
I'd have taken

549
00:24:39,310 --> 00:24:40,570
every one of them down.

550
00:24:41,600 --> 00:24:42,710
Forget about that.

551
00:24:43,270 --> 00:24:44,990
You're back safe,
and that's what matters.

552
00:24:44,990 --> 00:24:45,710
Ruhui,

553
00:24:45,990 --> 00:24:46,710
no offense,

554
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,860
but you've got quite a temper.

555
00:24:49,980 --> 00:24:51,380
You're right, Senior Du.

556
00:24:51,850 --> 00:24:53,180
I won't dare do it again.

557
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:54,470
I know

558
00:24:54,990 --> 00:24:56,560
you did it for our Longxuya Branch.

559
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:58,110
If anything had happened to the bodies,

560
00:24:58,110 --> 00:25:00,840
we'd have had a hard time
explaining it tomorrow.

561
00:25:01,070 --> 00:25:02,680
Thank you for understanding, Senior Du.

562
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,540
How about this?

563
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:04,970
I'll get us some food

564
00:25:05,310 --> 00:25:07,100
and give you a proper welcome back.

565
00:25:07,100 --> 00:25:07,700
Senior Du,

566
00:25:07,980 --> 00:25:09,240
you really shouldn't.

567
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:11,340
I just caused you so much trouble,

568
00:25:11,340 --> 00:25:12,340
and yet you still—

569
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:13,550
Ruhui,

570
00:25:14,230 --> 00:25:14,990
say no more.

571
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:16,510
I've seen how you've performed

572
00:25:16,510 --> 00:25:17,550
throughout this trip.

573
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:18,200
Besides,

574
00:25:18,540 --> 00:25:19,270
you could say

575
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:20,920
we've finished this job smoothly enough.

576
00:25:20,920 --> 00:25:21,550
Tonight,

577
00:25:21,790 --> 00:25:22,470
let's have

578
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:24,030
a good drink together.

579
00:25:24,030 --> 00:25:24,710
Get some rest first

580
00:25:24,710 --> 00:25:26,110
and change your clothes.

581
00:25:27,990 --> 00:25:29,520
Come on, sit down, sit down.

582
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,250
You're this badly hurt.

583
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,970
No drinking tonight, okay?

584
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,080
Thank you, Senior Du.

585
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,120
Cheers.

586
00:25:43,750 --> 00:25:44,350
Senior Du,

587
00:25:44,600 --> 00:25:45,780
thank you for being so forgiving
despite my mistake.

588
00:25:45,780 --> 00:25:47,200
I'd like to raise a toast to you.

589
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:47,960
No need to be so formal, Ruhui.

590
00:25:47,960 --> 00:25:48,990
Thank you, Senior Du.

591
00:25:48,990 --> 00:25:49,840
You've worked hard on this journey.

592
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:50,470
Thank you.

593
00:25:50,660 --> 00:25:51,590
You're welcome.

594
00:25:55,470 --> 00:25:56,120
Let's raise

595
00:25:56,120 --> 00:25:57,230
another toast to Senior Du.

596
00:25:57,230 --> 00:25:57,600
Here.

597
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,470
It's my duty.

598
00:25:58,990 --> 00:26:00,030
Bottoms up.

599
00:26:09,510 --> 00:26:10,680
Senior Du,

600
00:26:12,380 --> 00:26:13,210
this cup...

601
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:41,550
Ruhui!

602
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:43,030
Ruhui,

603
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,440
get up.

604
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:45,030
Wake up.

605
00:26:46,440 --> 00:26:47,370
Morning, Liang.

606
00:26:47,390 --> 00:26:48,840
Forget the pleasantries.
Something's happened.

607
00:26:48,840 --> 00:26:49,950
Senior Du is missing.

608
00:26:49,950 --> 00:26:52,160
I've looked everywhere,
but I can't find him.

609
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:53,270
Maybe he got up early

610
00:26:53,270 --> 00:26:55,070
and went out for a walk.

611
00:26:55,070 --> 00:26:56,070
Why are you getting so worked up?

612
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:57,100
It's not
that I'm getting worked up for nothing.

613
00:26:57,100 --> 00:26:59,430
All the valuables he brought are gone too.

614
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,810
Could those corpses

615
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,230
have risen

616
00:27:04,380 --> 00:27:05,840
and killed him last night?

617
00:27:07,010 --> 00:27:08,820
Why would they hurt us

618
00:27:09,230 --> 00:27:10,470
after we carried them all the way back?

619
00:27:10,470 --> 00:27:11,510
Then go ask them.

620
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:14,990
Liang,

621
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:20,170
have you ever been bullied by ghosts?

622
00:27:20,350 --> 00:27:20,870
No.

623
00:27:21,050 --> 00:27:23,180
I've only ever been bullied by people.

624
00:27:27,540 --> 00:27:28,670
Where are you going?

625
00:27:37,180 --> 00:27:39,780
This doesn't look like
a corpse rising either.

626
00:27:47,350 --> 00:27:48,280
A gunshot wound.

627
00:27:49,330 --> 00:27:50,730
Open it up and take a look.

628
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:54,200
Where's the stuff?

629
00:27:54,710 --> 00:27:55,230
Liang,

630
00:27:55,610 --> 00:27:57,940
go check the other four corpses. Quickly.

631
00:28:21,430 --> 00:28:23,190
All the opium paste is gone—

632
00:28:23,280 --> 00:28:25,740
how come two blocks
were left in this corpse?

633
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:40,960
Liang,

634
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:43,870
remember what I told you before?

635
00:28:44,510 --> 00:28:45,790
Ghosts never hurt you.

636
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:47,670
It's people

637
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:49,440
who do.

638
00:29:00,050 --> 00:29:01,130
Easy, Sir.

639
00:29:01,350 --> 00:29:02,350
This way, please.

640
00:29:18,310 --> 00:29:18,920
Mr. Zheng?

641
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,750
Have you fried your brain
on that damn opium?

642
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:24,680
Take a good look.

643
00:29:25,030 --> 00:29:26,120
My surname is Xu.

644
00:29:26,670 --> 00:29:27,230
Search them.

645
00:29:27,230 --> 00:29:28,430
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

646
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:36,990
Let's go.

647
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:43,070
Found it.

648
00:29:44,840 --> 00:29:45,400
Colonel,

649
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,440
we found this.

650
00:29:54,150 --> 00:29:54,870
You two,

651
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:57,320
anything else to say?

652
00:29:58,790 --> 00:29:59,440
Officer,

653
00:29:59,710 --> 00:30:01,160
we didn't put this there.

654
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:02,550
Then who did?

655
00:30:04,030 --> 00:30:04,640
He did.

656
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,440
Didn't you get beaten enough?

657
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,770
Stop talking nonsense.

658
00:30:09,310 --> 00:30:10,720
You're caught red-handed,

659
00:30:10,720 --> 00:30:12,220
and you still dare accuse an officer.

660
00:30:12,220 --> 00:30:14,180
Looks like you won't tell the truth

661
00:30:14,430 --> 00:30:15,830
until I teach you a lesson.

662
00:30:15,830 --> 00:30:16,310
Sir.

663
00:30:16,550 --> 00:30:17,210
Attention!

664
00:30:26,820 --> 00:30:28,150
Greetings, Commander.

665
00:30:33,070 --> 00:30:34,930
What brings you here, Commander?

666
00:30:47,290 --> 00:30:48,770
No need to trouble yourself, Commander.

667
00:30:48,770 --> 00:30:50,430
I've already taken care of it.

668
00:30:50,460 --> 00:30:51,590
Caught red-handed.

669
00:30:51,950 --> 00:30:54,680
Didn't you say opium
had been completely banned?

670
00:30:54,940 --> 00:30:55,550
Well,

671
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:57,600
these two

672
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:59,270
are outrageously bold—

673
00:30:59,270 --> 00:31:00,550
carrying on their crimes

674
00:31:00,550 --> 00:31:02,420
right under our noses
despite the crackdown.

675
00:31:02,420 --> 00:31:04,150
Don't worry, Commander. I'll—

676
00:31:14,140 --> 00:31:16,140
I'll interrogate these two myself.

677
00:31:16,550 --> 00:31:17,200
Um...

678
00:31:18,250 --> 00:31:18,910
Commander,

679
00:31:19,070 --> 00:31:19,840
these two

680
00:31:19,840 --> 00:31:20,970
never tell the truth

681
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:22,100
No need to trouble yourself.

682
00:31:22,100 --> 00:31:23,030
Leave them to us.

683
00:31:28,580 --> 00:31:29,730
You have no say in this.

684
00:31:29,730 --> 00:31:30,190
Get out!

685
00:31:30,750 --> 00:31:31,280
Yes, sir.

686
00:31:32,310 --> 00:31:33,070
Take them all away.

687
00:31:33,070 --> 00:31:33,600
Yes, sir.

688
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,540
Take them away.

689
00:32:16,030 --> 00:32:16,560
How is it?

690
00:32:23,840 --> 00:32:24,570
Colonel Lei,

691
00:32:25,590 --> 00:32:26,970
the goods have arrived safely.

692
00:32:26,970 --> 00:32:28,770
Why do you still look so worried?

693
00:32:30,840 --> 00:32:33,070
Longxuya risked everything

694
00:32:33,140 --> 00:32:34,210
to cover my losses.

695
00:32:34,650 --> 00:32:35,730
I, Lei, would like

696
00:32:36,080 --> 00:32:37,880
to thank you first and foremost.

697
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:39,120
It's just...

698
00:32:39,550 --> 00:32:41,920
It's just that those two fall guys

699
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:44,360
have ended up in Commander Feng's hands.

700
00:32:45,050 --> 00:32:47,650
You can't help but worry,
can you, Colonel Lei?

701
00:32:51,510 --> 00:32:52,680
Looks like

702
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:54,470
you already have a solution.

703
00:32:54,470 --> 00:32:55,120
If you ask me,

704
00:32:55,120 --> 00:32:56,030
Colonel Lei,

705
00:32:56,030 --> 00:32:58,440
you can put your mind at ease.

706
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,750
There's no need to worry.

707
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:01,550
Commander Feng has no evidence.

708
00:33:01,550 --> 00:33:03,840
Why would he believe the nonsense

709
00:33:03,990 --> 00:33:05,520
those two swindlers spout?

710
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:06,470
If anything

711
00:33:06,470 --> 00:33:08,990
does turn up later

712
00:33:08,990 --> 00:33:10,520
and it comes back to you two,

713
00:33:10,960 --> 00:33:13,290
just insist that it's a false accusation,

714
00:33:13,370 --> 00:33:15,570
and you'll have nothing to worry about.

715
00:33:16,460 --> 00:33:16,990
Chief Du,

716
00:33:18,070 --> 00:33:19,130
I'll still need you

717
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,850
to help me find buyers
for this shipment.

718
00:33:20,850 --> 00:33:23,250
I'll let you know as soon
as I have an update.

719
00:33:24,600 --> 00:33:25,200
All right.

720
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:27,040
We won't keep you any longer.

721
00:33:28,790 --> 00:33:29,310
Please.

722
00:33:34,270 --> 00:33:35,160
Take care, gentlemen.

723
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:35,760
All right.

724
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:46,640
Uncle,

725
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:49,040
the buyer for this shipment

726
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,290
is already lined up.

727
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,230
When should we make the delivery?

728
00:33:52,230 --> 00:33:52,750
No rush.

729
00:33:53,540 --> 00:33:54,800
Wait for further word.

730
00:33:55,120 --> 00:33:57,160
Only once that Lyu Ruhui is dead

731
00:33:57,660 --> 00:33:58,660
can everything

732
00:33:58,790 --> 00:34:00,220
finally be settled.

733
00:34:01,030 --> 00:34:01,790
Heng.

734
00:34:02,570 --> 00:34:05,050
Do as I told you before.

735
00:34:05,640 --> 00:34:07,160
Once this is over,

736
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:09,969
take the money
you've saved over the years

737
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:12,150
and leave Qianshan.

738
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,860
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

739
00:34:14,150 --> 00:34:14,679
Uncle...

740
00:34:15,239 --> 00:34:16,840
Never come back.

741
00:34:18,190 --> 00:34:18,760
Uncle,

742
00:34:19,929 --> 00:34:20,790
what about you?

743
00:34:21,270 --> 00:34:23,230
I know too much.

744
00:34:24,280 --> 00:34:27,280
I'm afraid I'll have to spend
the rest of my days in the Tianxiang Sect.

745
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,880
But as long as I'm still here,

746
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:31,330
no one will care where you go.

747
00:34:32,730 --> 00:34:34,520
That's why I can't leave.

748
00:34:35,989 --> 00:34:36,510
Uncle,

749
00:34:36,889 --> 00:34:37,620
how about...

750
00:34:42,159 --> 00:34:44,360
I'll go back to my room and get some rest.

751
00:34:57,050 --> 00:35:00,530
When did you pick up this opium habit?

752
00:35:03,300 --> 00:35:03,760
Uncle,

753
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,320
you...

754
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:15,420
I told you before,

755
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:17,670
I won't interfere
with your drinking, eating,

756
00:35:17,670 --> 00:35:19,030
whoring, or gambling.

757
00:35:19,180 --> 00:35:20,300
But you absolutely

758
00:35:20,610 --> 00:35:22,010
cannot touch opium.

759
00:35:30,630 --> 00:35:31,240
Uncle,

760
00:35:32,070 --> 00:35:33,070
I know I was wrong.

761
00:35:33,550 --> 00:35:33,960
I...

762
00:35:35,070 --> 00:35:36,030
I'll quit.

763
00:35:37,460 --> 00:35:38,590
I promise I'll quit.

764
00:36:27,090 --> 00:36:30,770
[Half a month later]

765
00:36:57,550 --> 00:36:58,920
Gentlemen,

766
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:01,080
you've all inspected the goods.

767
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:02,320
Satisfied?

768
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:04,320
Satisfied.

769
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:05,470
Very satisfied.

770
00:37:06,070 --> 00:37:06,960
Good to hear.

771
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:08,630
However,

772
00:37:09,470 --> 00:37:11,000
the price for this shipment

773
00:37:11,470 --> 00:37:13,870
will be 30% higher
than originally agreed.

774
00:37:14,510 --> 00:37:15,070
Well...

775
00:37:18,190 --> 00:37:20,510
You all know what things
are like in Qianshan.

776
00:37:20,510 --> 00:37:21,670
We lost quite a few of our men

777
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:23,270
getting this shipment here.

778
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:24,760
The extra 30%

779
00:37:25,030 --> 00:37:27,760
will go
toward the burial expenses for those men.

780
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:28,840
Do we have a deal?

781
00:37:31,190 --> 00:37:31,650
Well...

782
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,450
Adjutant Xu,

783
00:37:34,720 --> 00:37:36,920
that's quite a difference

784
00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:38,110
from the price we agreed on.

785
00:37:38,110 --> 00:37:39,150
I don't have

786
00:37:39,240 --> 00:37:41,510
that much cash on hand right now.

787
00:37:41,990 --> 00:37:44,550
Why don't you offer it to someone else?

788
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:45,760
I'll pass

789
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:48,920
on this shipment.

790
00:37:49,470 --> 00:37:50,200
Adjutant Xu,

791
00:37:50,230 --> 00:37:51,410
I'm short on cash too.

792
00:37:51,410 --> 00:37:53,210
I'll have to pass.

793
00:37:55,550 --> 00:37:57,550
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

794
00:38:03,110 --> 00:38:03,760
Speak up!

795
00:38:05,470 --> 00:38:06,730
Let me make this clear:

796
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:08,440
you're taking this shipment

797
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:10,150
whether you want it

798
00:38:11,070 --> 00:38:12,320
or not.

799
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:15,020
Do I make myself clear?

800
00:38:37,190 --> 00:38:37,880
Commander,

801
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:39,440
what brings you here?

802
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:44,740
Commander, you may have misunderstood.

803
00:38:44,740 --> 00:38:46,220
Adjutant Xu and I

804
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,360
were trying to lure them out,

805
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,070
wipe

806
00:38:48,630 --> 00:38:49,440
them all out,

807
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:50,360
and then

808
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,570
report back to you.

809
00:38:54,470 --> 00:38:55,330
Premium goods.

810
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,720
I was just outside

811
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,620
and I think I heard Adjutant Xu say

812
00:39:00,070 --> 00:39:01,280
that the price for this shipment

813
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:03,190
is 30% higher than usual.

814
00:39:03,470 --> 00:39:06,270
And it seems you weren't
willing to pay, am I right?

815
00:39:08,720 --> 00:39:10,800
I don't quite understand.

816
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:14,130
Why weren't you willing to pay?

817
00:39:14,990 --> 00:39:16,150
This shipment was brought here

818
00:39:16,150 --> 00:39:18,110
inside the bodies of my fallen men.

819
00:39:18,820 --> 00:39:21,300
They gave their lives for me.

820
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,920
They didn't even get a proper burial.

821
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:23,720
Instead,

822
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:26,550
their riddled corpses

823
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:27,550
were cut

824
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:28,320
open,

825
00:39:28,410 --> 00:39:30,920
their insides removed,
every last organ taken out.

826
00:39:30,920 --> 00:39:32,150
If I'm not mistaken,

827
00:39:32,150 --> 00:39:33,030
the cleaner

828
00:39:33,280 --> 00:39:34,920
they were emptied out, the better, right?

829
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:36,310
Because that's the only way

830
00:39:36,310 --> 00:39:38,090
you can pack in more opium paste,

831
00:39:38,090 --> 00:39:39,300
sew them back up,

832
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:40,590
and haul them

833
00:39:40,670 --> 00:39:41,320
here

834
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:42,850
through all that hardship,

835
00:39:45,470 --> 00:39:46,870
so you can make a fortune.

836
00:39:47,070 --> 00:39:49,360
They died clean.

837
00:39:49,590 --> 00:39:51,320
Now their bodies have been defiled.

838
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:52,320
Under

839
00:39:52,470 --> 00:39:54,110
Under these circumstances,

840
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:58,110
isn't a 30% price increase only fair?

841
00:40:18,360 --> 00:40:19,880
I heard you're blind.

842
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,920
You're not blind.

843
00:40:30,260 --> 00:40:32,180
You just think I'm the blind one.

844
00:40:35,190 --> 00:40:36,120
Commander Feng,

845
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:39,110
I've always had great respect
for you soldiers.

846
00:40:39,110 --> 00:40:41,680
I was deceived by Colonel Lei too.

847
00:40:41,880 --> 00:40:44,800
He told me these bodies belonged to miners
who had died in an accident.

848
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,960
I was only running an errand for him,

849
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:49,400
making a little money for my trouble.

850
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:50,400
You know full well

851
00:40:50,990 --> 00:40:53,030
how many dirty deeds
you've all been involved in

852
00:40:53,030 --> 00:40:54,570
behind the scenes over the years.

853
00:40:54,570 --> 00:40:55,970
Now that he's dead,

854
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,920
you're next.

855
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:11,110
I see.

856
00:41:12,990 --> 00:41:13,670
Kid,

857
00:41:13,760 --> 00:41:15,190
if I'd known this would happen,

858
00:41:15,190 --> 00:41:16,850
I should've killed you myself

859
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:19,550
back at Longxuya.

860
00:41:27,380 --> 00:41:28,220
Du Binghui,

861
00:41:28,790 --> 00:41:29,940
you're not dead yet.

862
00:41:31,290 --> 00:41:32,770
How could I bear to die?

863
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,150
We're corpse drivers,

864
00:41:50,150 --> 00:41:51,440
taking the dead home.

865
00:41:51,530 --> 00:41:53,300
You're dressed

866
00:41:53,380 --> 00:41:55,580
as if you were about to perform in a play.

867
00:41:56,150 --> 00:41:57,150
How fascinating.

868
00:41:57,280 --> 00:41:59,150
The corpse can even move on its own.

869
00:41:59,150 --> 00:42:00,550
How do you do that?

870
00:42:01,350 --> 00:42:02,510
[Blind Du isn't blind]

871
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:08,400
I'll put you somewhere else

872
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,190
so you can cool off.

873
00:42:10,190 --> 00:42:10,800
Move!

874
00:42:15,830 --> 00:42:17,160
Where are you taking me?

875
00:42:20,550 --> 00:42:21,510
Wait here.

876
00:42:27,850 --> 00:42:49,510
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

877
00:42:57,870 --> 00:42:59,240
This is the new performer.

878
00:42:59,240 --> 00:42:59,990
Her stage name is Feiyan.

879
00:42:59,990 --> 00:43:00,800
What are you doing?

880
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:01,800
What are you doing?

881
00:43:01,800 --> 00:43:03,920
No one has ever celebrated
my birthday for me.

882
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:04,590
Thank you.

883
00:43:04,670 --> 00:43:05,270
Mom,

884
00:43:05,510 --> 00:43:06,360
I'll go get a doctor.

885
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:07,990
You haven't eaten anything all night.

886
00:43:07,990 --> 00:43:08,990
Come and have some porridge.

887
00:43:08,990 --> 00:43:10,240
Since we've tied the knot,

888
00:43:10,240 --> 00:43:11,190
we're husband and wife.

889
00:43:11,190 --> 00:43:12,360
Your business is my business.

890
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:13,440
How can I stay out of it?

891
00:43:13,440 --> 00:43:14,360
From now on,

892
00:43:14,440 --> 00:43:16,150
every minute and every second

893
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:17,510
belongs to us.

894
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:18,800
I once

895
00:43:19,150 --> 00:43:21,190
ran into an old gentleman surnamed Du.

896
00:43:21,190 --> 00:43:22,920
He said I was born to bring ruin,

897
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:24,630
first to my parents and friends,

898
00:43:24,630 --> 00:43:26,090
then to any devoted lover.

899
00:43:26,240 --> 00:43:27,770
Everyone who treats me well

900
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:28,590
ends up

901
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:30,550
dying because of me.

902
00:43:34,450 --> 00:43:36,710
[In the next episode]

903
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:37,990
Liang,

904
00:43:38,110 --> 00:43:39,470
my name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

905
00:43:39,840 --> 00:43:41,640
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

906
00:43:42,180 --> 00:43:44,380
The road I'm about to take is dangerous.

907
00:43:44,540 --> 00:43:45,690
We should go our separate ways.

908
00:43:45,690 --> 00:43:47,820
If you're in danger, all the more reason
I should come with you.

909
00:43:47,820 --> 00:43:49,880
What if I have to kill the Sect Master?

910
00:43:50,570 --> 00:43:51,780
Take my advice.

911
00:43:51,990 --> 00:43:53,450
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

912
00:43:53,930 --> 00:43:55,140
None of them

913
00:43:56,060 --> 00:43:57,270
will die a peaceful death.
